  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Sai.<br>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>15</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>71</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>33</mn><mi>′</mi><mn>54</mn><mi>″</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>360</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>71</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>33</mn><mi>′</mi><mn>54</mn><mi>″</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>48</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>26</mn><mi>′</mi><mn>6</mn><mi>″</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Làm tròn đến đơn vị phút, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>48</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>26</mn><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Đúng.<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> m.</li><li>Đúng.<br>Áp dụng định lý sin trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow><mrow><mo>sin</mo><msup><mn>48</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mn>26</mn><mi>′</mi><mn>6</mn><mi>″</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/7abf06e92e73b0be05b7595dbf48f50d7e8f167c8ecb0ce5bb3d55ef0f780d1e.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
